<title>USA: Golden Books Q3 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Golden Books Q3 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr   loss		 $0.73     loss	 $1.79</p>
<p> Net   loss		15,535     loss	37,488</p>
<p> Revs			89,541		  105,216</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  24,416		   21,043</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $6.07     loss	 $2.59</p>
<p> Net	loss	  133,689     loss	53,837</p>
<p> Revs		     224,397		  283,428</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  22,784		   21,030</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: The 1996 nine months includes restructuring and other one-time charges of $96.3 million.</p>
<p>Q3 ended Nov 2.</p>
<p>The company said it will change its fiscal year to end on the last Saturday of December each year.</p>
<p>Full company name is Golden Books Family Entertainment Inc.</p>
